a  played by karen killian is also set to  make a comeback after the death of her  father thanos she will be able to travel  through space much more freely and come  across as less grim the release of  guardians of the galaxy vol 3 is  scheduled for may 5th 2023 so we will  have to wait a little longer  the netflix blockbuster the gray man  started with mixed reviews on the  streaming platform last weekend thanks  to its strong celebrity cast including  ryan gosling and the armas and chris  evans the grey man did at least manage  decent streaming figures although the  action film falls behind other top class  movies such as red notice and don't look  up it is still the fifth most successful  netflix movie of all time as the russo  brothers who directed the film confirmed  to deadline this week the movie will get  at least two more follow-ups first a  sequel is being planned that will tie in  with the events of the first part second  we can also look forward to spin-off in  the sequel both the russo brothers and  actor ryan gosling will surely return  while the spin-off will highlight other  aspects of mark greene's novel getting  involved so far are deadpool authors  paul roernick and red rhys who will  write a spin of screenplay on top of  that joe russo announced that you can  look forward to an r-rating here have  you seen the grey man and if so what do  you guys think about the idea of  releasing two more movies feel free to  write us in the comments  all right that was our news vote this  week you haven't had enough yet then  check out our latest original for a  movie preview of captain marvel 2 the  marvels we've also prepared a great  compilation of all the new trailers  released at comic con ready for you to  watch on our channel we hope you enjoy  it  [Music]

